# Fixture input for `cctally explain`.
#
# The one fixture that does NOT render in `Etc/UTC`. Every other scenario runs
# in the single zone whose rendering looked correct while S2's zone defect was
# live, so this is the only golden that can catch a bound converted into the
# wrong zone or a zone printed as a bare numeric offset.
#
# The seed is `_short_context_dominant`'s, so this golden also covers the S3
# surface — a conversation-derived contributor and its evidence line — rather
# than only the accounting rows.
#
# The bounds are EXACT instants rather than a date range, so the window is
# byte-identical to `short-context-dominant`'s and only the rendering zone
# differs. A date-only `--window` token is parsed in the display zone, which
# would shift the window by three hours and change which entries it holds —
# that would test a different question.
AS_OF="2026-08-17T00:00:00Z"
FLAGS="--start-at 2026-08-10T00:00:00Z --end-at 2026-08-17T00:00:00Z --source claude --tz Asia/Jerusalem"
